# Model directory placeholder
#
# Place Gemma 4 model files here before building:
#
#   gemma4_e4b_q4.task   (~5.2 GB)  — Primary reasoning model (E4B, Q4 quantized)
#   gemma4_e2b_q4.task   (~2.8 GB)  — Fallback model for low-RAM devices (E2B, Q4)
#
# Download from:
#   Google AI Edge Gallery: https://ai.google.dev/edge/mediapipe/solutions/genai/llm_inference
#   Kaggle: https://www.kaggle.com/models/google/gemma
#   Hugging Face: https://huggingface.co/google/gemma-4
#
# IMPORTANT: Model files are excluded from this repository (.gitignore)
# They must be placed locally before building a production APK.
# The debug APK built by CI will build successfully but will show a
# 'Model not found' error at runtime until the model file is present.
#
# For CI builds demonstrating the app shell, the GemmaEngine gracefully
# handles a missing model and falls back to mock responses.
